  "description": "The GIS certificate for local government is designed for city or county government employees seeking expertise in geographic information systems and science (GIS). The program is a good fit for those who want to learn to use GIS, mapping, and spatial analysis in public service. Grounded in a virtue-driven approach to GIS, attention is given to spatial data collection and processing, network and location intelligence, community demographics, online mapping and analysis, and cartographic communication.",
